   "widgets_values": [
    "## 2 · Models\nQwen-Image-Edit-2511 + Lightning LoRA (4 steps, cfg 1). For maximum quality bypass the Lightning LoRA and set every KSampler to **steps 40 / cfg 4**.\n\nUses the INT8 ConvRot weights (19 GB). Best quality on a 32 GB+ GPU: pick `qwen_image_edit_2511_bf16.safetensors` in the UNETLoader (38 GB; StandRig Setup can download and switch it).\n\nThe Multiple-Angles LoRA (fal) is only used by the turnaround sheet; StandRig targets use exact-degree instructions on the base model."
   ],
